# Copy to a file that is NOT committed. See README, Security.

# Path B only. Wireless ADB serial. Example is documentation-range, not a real host.
SNAP_SERIAL=192.0.2.10:5555

# Both paths. Mode 600. Never commit the real files.
SNAP_PIN_FILE=./secrets/pin
SNAP_ENV=./secrets/env
SNAP_CHATS=./secrets/chats

# secrets/env is one line. Name is TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN. Value is the token from BotFather. Do not commit that file.

# secrets/chats contains one Telegram chat id, one line, no quotes.
# secrets/to is optional. Empty or missing means the fire chip + Select All.
# A name in secrets/to sends to that one person for runs that read the file.

# Optional. Activity that shows "bot is running" before taps. Skip if unset.
# SNAP_ANNOUNCE=your.package/.YourActivity
